      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعْشَعٌ</span></b> , (S, O,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعْشَاعٌ</span></b> , (K,) or both, (TA,)
